# Frontend: Report APIs

Base URL: `http://116.193.129.229:8092`

All report APIs are **GET**. Pass filters in the **query string** (Params tab), not in a JSON body.

Headers:

```
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {token}
```

Token from `POST /api/login`:

```json
{
  "user_code": "0112",
  "password": "Password@123"
}
```

---

## Date filters (booking, reservation, collection)

Use **either** a date range **or** a month:

| Param | Example | Notes |
|---|---|---|
| `from_date` | `2026-09-01` | Required if `month` is not sent |
| `to_date` | `2026-09-30` | Required with `from_date`. Must be >= `from_date` |
| `month` | `2026-09` | `YYYY-MM`. Becomes first day to last day of that month |

Reservation report can skip dates if `reservation_no` is sent alone.

---

## 1. Booking register

`GET /api/report/booking`

Filter: booking **created date**.

```
http://116.193.129.229:8092/api/report/booking?from_date=2026-09-01&to_date=2026-09-30
http://116.193.129.229:8092/api/report/booking?month=2026-09
```

Response extras: `total_records`, `total_advance`.

Row fields include `Register_Date`, `Booking_No`, `Guest_Name`, `Contact_No`, `Room_TName`, `NoOf_Room`, `CheckIn_Date`, `ExpChkOut_Dt`, `Agent_Name`, `Adv_Amount`.

---

## 2. Reservation register

`GET /api/report/reservation`

| Param | Required | Notes |
|---|---|---|
| `from_date` / `to_date` or `month` | yes, unless only `reservation_no` | Created date range |
| `reservation_no` | no | One reservation. Can be sent alone |

```
http://116.193.129.229:8092/api/report/reservation?from_date=2026-09-01&to_date=2026-09-30
http://116.193.129.229:8092/api/report/reservation?reservation_no=22260001
http://116.193.129.229:8092/api/report/reservation?from_date=2026-09-01&to_date=2026-09-30&reservation_no=22260001
```

Response extras: `total_records`, `total_amount_paid`.

Row fields include `Reservation_No`, `Booking_No`, `Guest_Name`, `CheckIn_Date`, `Room_Nos`, `Agent_Name`, `Amount_Paid`, `Checkout_Status` (`1` = checked out, `0` = not).

---

## 3. Collection register

`GET /api/report/collection`

Frontend dropdown **collection type**:

| Value | UI | Params |
|---|---|---|
| `summary` | Date / month filter, all collections | `collection_type=summary` + dates or `month` |
| `reservation` | Reservation no + dates | `collection_type=reservation` + `reservation_no` + dates or `month` |

```
http://116.193.129.229:8092/api/report/collection?collection_type=summary&from_date=2026-09-01&to_date=2026-09-30
http://116.193.129.229:8092/api/report/collection?collection_type=summary&month=2026-09
http://116.193.129.229:8092/api/report/collection?collection_type=reservation&reservation_no=22260001&from_date=2026-09-01&to_date=2026-09-30
```

Filter date is `Coll_Date`.

Response extras: `collection_type`, `reservation_no`, `total_records`, `total_collection`.

Row fields include `Register_Date`, `Collection_Id`, `Reservation_No`, `Guest_Name`, `Coll_Amount`, `Coll_Mode`, `Final_Coll`, `Agent_Name`.

