## 4. Agent commission (month wise)

`GET /api/report/agent-commission`

Frontend dropdown **commission type**:

| Value | UI | Params | Result |
|---|---|---|---|
| `all` | All agents | `commission_type=all` + `month` | One total row per agent |
| `agent` | One agent | `commission_type=agent` + `month` + `agent_id` | One row per reservation/checkout |

`month` is required (`YYYY-MM`). Commission is checkout `Agent_Comm_Amount` = `Room_Bill × agent Comm_Prcnt`.

```
http://116.193.129.229:8092/api/report/agent-commission?commission_type=all&month=2026-10
http://116.193.129.229:8092/api/report/agent-commission?commission_type=agent&month=2026-10&agent_id=9
```

Response extras: `commission_type`, `month`, `agent_id`, `total_records`, `total_room_bill`, `total_commission`.

**All** row: `Comm_Month`, `Agent_Id`, `Agent_Name`, `Checkout_Count`, `Room_Bill`, `Agent_Comm_Amount`.

**Agent** row: `Comm_Month`, `CheckOut_Date`, `Checkout_Id`, `Bill_No`, `Reservation_No`, `Guest_Name`, `Agent_Name`, `Room_Bill`, `Agent_Comm_Amount`.

